Z||000000||RiceCooker||07-18-2001||01:32 PM||||Dave Gulevich & Sharon Bremness brought their first son into the world and said, "Let's name him......RiceCooker" LOL! That's not my real name, jeez. <P>Yay! I'm 21 and lovin every minute of it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Life is great and I just wanna say how happy i am and how much i love you all (sniff, sniff)<P>Heh, I'll have a drink for every person who wishes me a happy birthday. Just don't make it a Fierolisa thread, or I'll be Dead  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Let's see, what do i want for my birthday...Hmmm some eibachs would be nice, a digital camera so i can take some recent pics, and maybe a nice blue choptop.<P>Right now I'll settle for ashtray lids. Seriously, does anybody have ashtray lids?<P>Well, That's all i have to say, Have a happy July 18th everyone and I'll see ya around.<P>Later,<BR>Todd  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>What do you call cheese that isn't yours?<BR>Nacho cheese (say it)<P>What do you call an emptry container of Cheese Whiz (TM)? <P>Cheese was.<P>LOL Yeah right (cheesey jokes, eh?) <BR> <BR><P>------------------<BR>This is my witty signature,<BR>It makes me cool||||reg||6
